Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.58,0:00:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling, Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sailing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,on the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,cobalt blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The clouds float above the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanging out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,just me and you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Our time is now and soon you'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile with all your heart as you go\Npast the problems that await you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your hopes alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.82,0:00:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Never look down upon yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just cast a magic spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You will get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Star, twinkle, twinkle!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fast beats!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.86,0:00:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Premonitions!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.86,0:00:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the colors from\Nall the rainbow beams!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow! Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.34,0:01:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me and we'll go far!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just fallen angels!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shooting arrows into our hopeful dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.44,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.30,0:01:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Twinkle, twinkle rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.84,0:01:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Within the cobalt blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven colors will come to our surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.54,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Twinkle, twinkle rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon all your worries!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.10,0:01:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your troubles show through\Nthe mirror of your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.02,0:02:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me comfort you, my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold your time within my glove!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We sure are fallen angels!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just singing our hearts\Nall out from up above!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Dying, dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy hippo star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a crazy hippo star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy hippo star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.64,0:02:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a crazy hippo star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.02,0:02:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one of our former chefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy your stay at\Nthe Maritime Restaurant Baratie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Former home of Black Lake Sanji, the\Ninfamous cook with a 77 million fairy bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks just like him, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.78,0:03:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I propose a toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.60,0:03:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.32,0:03:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the biggest name in all of East\NBlue, with a bounty of 300 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.86,0:03:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet down, the whole lot of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you fools no shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.30,0:03:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No one listens to what\Nthe mayor says anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cute pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy must be having so much fun out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like he's made\Nsome wonderful friends as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You call those thugs friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're criminals!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Our town gave birth to a wanted criminal\Nthat turned against the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:04:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And what kind of pirate is crazy enough\Nto declare war on the darn government?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.32,0:04:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Garp needs to clean up this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.04,0:04:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If he hadn't left his\Ngrandson here on this island,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.42,0:04:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,none of this would have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That family's been crazy\Nfor three generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Dada knows\Nabout all this. To Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I said quiet down, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.16,0:04:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniper King.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The king of the snipers. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.98,0:04:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You got the captain's nose, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All the people in the\Nvillage didn't believe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's worth 30 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.44,0:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if no one else could,\Nwe knew you'd recognize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everyone in the world\Ncan know how awesome he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.56,0:04:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain has the power\Nto make lies the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All you gotta do is believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.90,0:04:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know where he got\Nit, but that mask is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if we can make\Nour own out of clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaya, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I should get back to my\Nmedical studies, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.36,0:04:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to become a good\Ndoctor as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.76,0:04:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, if Usopp comes back here\Ninjured after all his adventures,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'll be able to fix him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, the captain sure is lucky, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm going to beat him up\Nif he ever makes Kaia sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.66,0:05:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, is it true that Pirate Hunter\NZoro used to study at this school too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, yes, that is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't want you to\Nsee him as a role model.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.25,0:05:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach us to be pirates too,\Nso we can be strong like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't teach him or\Nanyone else to be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you lying to us, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.92,0:05:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You never can tell quite\Nhow they'll turn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I was surprised to hear about\Nwhat happened on Eni's lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.74,0:05:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure there isn't a speck of\Ndoubt in your heart, right, Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what kind of person you become,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.14,0:05:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,all I want is for you to cherish\Nyour own way of the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.50,0:05:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Genzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought some tangerines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, Nojiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep telling you I can\Nbuy them in the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.98,0:05:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be uptight about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you're like a\Nfather to me and Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.24,0:05:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dream of charging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:05:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.22,0:06:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.03,0:06:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to file a complaint to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Navy headquarters with\Nthe transponder snail,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but they won't pick up the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A complaint?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.66,0:06:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Navy? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.20,0:06:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they really think\Nthey can distribute such
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.44,0:06:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,an explicit wanted poster\Nall over the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.70,0:06:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, she'll have more marriage\Nsuitors than bounty hunters after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you seem to like the picture at\Nleast, seeing as you blew it up so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.82,0:06:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't let it get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, at least you know\Nthey kept their promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.10,0:06:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Lamy's going away with you, but if\Nany of you ever do anything to hurt her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That smile is all the proof we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose so, but I'd rather\Nshe stop being a pirate. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to take that smile away?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kureha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dalton, what did you call\Nme down here for, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a very busy woman, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sorry to trouble you, but when\Nyou see these, I think you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not gonna ask me the\Nsecret to my eternal youth?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way, Dalton,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,since you're the king and all, don't\Nyou think you should live in the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rent a room out to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.78,0:07:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I've stayed in this village for so\Nlong that I think I prefer it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I also prefer to have\Nchestnuts with my rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't the Straw Hat\Nkid and all his little friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Their new wanted poster\Nshowed up after that incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.58,0:07:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.49,0:07:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, I'm sure the amount\Nis some sort of mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing his face again is worth\Nall the berries in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good as long as he's happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:08:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, what in the world is Miss\NAll Sunday doing on Luffy's crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew there was something mysterious about\Nthat woman, but this is quite the shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If this news reaches Princess Vivi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine how\Ndisheartened she would be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I already heard about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.94,0:08:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.10,0:08:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.44,0:08:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you of all\Npeople would be shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when you're as close\Nto Luke Lee as I was,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you can never quite\Ntell what he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether I understand his reasoning or not,\NI still believe in everything he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I know that he's going to\Nbe king of the pirates one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.90,0:08:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The best we can do is\Nrespect his decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.90,0:08:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How forgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You've turned into such a fine\Nyoung lady, Princess Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's nothing to cry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Our forces have triumphed in Centaurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Another kingdom has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on a roll, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We had a big victory\Nin the North Blue, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:08:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is war.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:09:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in victory, we must be humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.08,0:09:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The posters?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're for the Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who took\Nout Crocodile and Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They recently caused a big\Nincident at Enies Lobby, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The government can't afford\Nto ignore them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,After their recent actions, their total\Nbounty jumped to 666 million and 50 berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, their captain is Vice\NAdmiral Garp's grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow your own beliefs to the end, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,With a will such as\Nyours and a little luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The masses may learn to\Nquestion this world after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ride the winds of change, my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That day you and I meet will\Ncome soon enough, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days before the Straw Hat\NPirates new bounties shocked the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Another history changing of it was\Nabout to occur not far from Water 7!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.40,0:10:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Bonero Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,a small settlement that\Nwill soon be turned
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,upside down in a duel\Nbetween fire and shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.51,0:10:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Commander Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no right to call me that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Use that title with respect,\Nbut don't use it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't have you mock me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, so this is the famous Fire Fist Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's me. You guessed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you've\Nbecome a captain now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Marshall D.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach of the Blackbeard Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.14,0:10:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on a slight enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.10,0:10:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.60,0:10:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't looking for me, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.52,0:10:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stop beating around\Nthe bush now, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you play dumb, I\Nknow you're a crafty bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.26,0:11:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one reason for me to\Nbe here, and you know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.96,0:11:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's one question\NI'd like to ask first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of fighting, why don't\Nyou become a member of my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the perfect plan\Nto rise to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you stick with me, I\Nswear we can rule the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.78,0:11:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's days are\Nnumbered and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates. First,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.86,0:11:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm headed off to Water\N7 to kill Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy as a special gift\Nto the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.14,0:11:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't hurt to have\Nyou along for the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.81,0:11:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're out of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.12,0:11:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I know him, you sack of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let you\Nkill my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.46,0:11:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not joining your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can take your little\Noffer and shove it up your...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:11:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.56,0:12:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you need to teach\Nyour crew some manners, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Flyer Filler!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Garbertus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.18,0:12:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you stay out of this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Until you get stronger, this\Nguy is out of your league!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.12,0:12:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.95,0:12:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly or bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.30,0:12:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.48,0:12:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of me, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.80,0:13:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All righty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to finish me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The murder of a fellow Gourmet\Nis a serious crime, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And yes, I killed 4th Division\NCommander Thatcher with my own hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but there wasn't any other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.08,0:13:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't personal, but he had the\NDevil Fruit I'd been searching for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.60,0:13:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the rules on Whitebeard's ship,\Nwhoever finds one of those gets to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I memorized the shapes and colors of all\Nthe devil's fruits that they discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,so I knew that was the one I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether I liked it or not, I spent decades\Nbiding my time on Whitebeard's ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,because that was the best shot I had\Nat finding that one single fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But just when I thought\Nthere was no hope left,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.34,0:13:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,there it was, right in\Nthe hand of my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you murdered him in cold blood\Nand stole it, without a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad luck for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This ability has chosen me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And its powers may be the\Nstrongest man in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.36,0:14:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Even among the Logia fruits,\Nthere's nothing quite like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.78,0:14:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, your body is made of fire, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.86,0:14:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My body is darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's that weird\Nblack smoke from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought those pirates were leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what they\Nwant, but it can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna wreck the\Nentire town at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we sure can't stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.22,0:14:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's best just to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Darkness...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.84,0:15:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see soon enough, Commander Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll want to\Nreconsider my offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.26,0:15:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In the history of all Devilfruits,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,this is said to be the most\Ndangerous power of them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.44,0:15:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Logia-type Dark Darkfruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, I've\Nbecome a Darkness man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.42,0:15:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a taste of its power!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.86,0:15:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't blink if I were\Nyou. Stop yapping and do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now ain't the time for\Na nap captain's on a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,rampage if we don't hide\Ntill it out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.62,0:15:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's crawling on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It keeps pouring out of him more and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pitch black, like a bottomless pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it sucks us up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone make a run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Run to the forest! Run to the coast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.52,0:16:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get away, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Darkness is gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It swallows everything around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Even light itself can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Its power is infinite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.82,0:16:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's nowhere near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you got the hang of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.40,0:16:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not aiming at you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be glad when you\Nsee what I do to this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hotel, it's being\Nswallowed into the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.02,0:17:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Within these shadows lies a limitless\Nvow to compress anything and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To crush whatever they touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.84,0:17:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll show you what\Nhappened to that town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:17:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Or whatever's left of it, I should say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Liberation!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing left but power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So do you get it now, Ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.18,0:18:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This was what I was willing\Nto tell a friend for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Firefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiery dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.46,0:18:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The darkness part I get,\Nbut this not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're a Loki attack, that\Nshouldn't hurt you, or rather,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,it shouldn't even hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.88,0:19:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.90,0:19:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,my darkness swallows everything\Naround it, whether it's punches,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,blades, bullets, lightning, or fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike you, I can't just turn into\Nan element and dodge an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.82,0:19:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And the pain I absorb when I get hit is\Nmuch greater than what a normal human feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.68,0:19:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But the trade-off for that\Ninconvenience is more than worth it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,because there happens to be\None other thing I can absorb.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Vortex!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.10,0:19:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.01,0:19:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I use the gravity of darkness to pull a\NDevil Fruit power holder into my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.94,0:19:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And then when I touch them
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.76,0:19:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're smart if you figured\Nout the secret yet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.16,0:20:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.54,0:20:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so long since you've been hit,\NI bet you forgot how much it hurts, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.84,0:20:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But you understand now, you\Nunderstood the second I grabbed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only can my darkness pull you in, it\Ncan also absorb your Devil Fruit power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, as long as\Nthey're in contact with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,someone with Devil Fruit powers is\Nno different than a normal human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.74,0:20:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Logia, Snow, Parameathia...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All those with Devil Fruit powers who have
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.76,0:20:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,become dependent on them\Nare in for a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,One little touch will remind\Nthem how weak they really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.44,0:21:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then all I have to do is\Navoid you if you think you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,can escape gravity that\Neasily I'd like to see you try
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard almost broke my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.48,0:21:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,His ability is going to be a\Nbigger pain than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Crossfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.74,0:22:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Banana Rock is falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.78,0:22:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's safe anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.24,0:22:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No one should have this kind of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.64,0:22:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are these monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.00,0:22:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.92,0:22:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll destroy the entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.18,0:22:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.60,0:22:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is quite a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.00,0:22:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Most Devil Fruit power\Nholders with one such as his!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.90,0:22:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Would be rendered ineffective as soon as\Ntheir trump card was taken away from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.74,0:22:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so with Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.14,0:22:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,His powers are not a crutch\Nbut an aid to his own talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.94,0:22:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We should expect no less from\None of Whitebeard's commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.44,0:22:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at the crossroads of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no coincidence that\Nthese men have been brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.96,0:23:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.87,0:23:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything falls before darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you can only struggle for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.96,0:23:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Still finishing you off here\Nwould be a waste of your talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.76,0:23:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.50,0:23:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If I surrender to you, then I could\Nnever call myself a man again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.44,0:23:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't submit and I won't live\Nwith regrets no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.50,0:23:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you die, your morals are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.50,0:23:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you can't understand that, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.56,0:23:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cardass, take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Green Flame Commandment!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.30,0:24:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.98,0:24:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun against darkness, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.56,0:24:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one can win!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.72,0:24:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make Whitebeard the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.18,0:24:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Or die trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.30,0:24:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.36,0:24:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Although no one realized it at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.72,0:24:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel at Benero Island\Nthat day was not merely
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.56,0:24:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,a struggle between\NWhitebeard and Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.04,0:24:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a catalyst.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.50,0:24:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the beginning of a chain of\Nevents that could change the world.
